SUMMARY:ByeTunes v2.6
DESCRIPTION:ByeTunes 2.6 | ByeTunes.v2.6.-.Version.fix\n\n# ByeTunes v2.6 
 – Favorites\, Playlist Pinning & Background Downloads Reworked\n\nHi guy
 s\, here is the 2.6 update for ByeTunes. A good amount of things got added
 \, fixed and improved in this one. You can now properly favorite injected 
 songs\, pin playlists from inside ByeTunes\, and keep downloads going in t
 he background with a new Picture in Picture window. There were also a bunc
 h of fixes around metadata\, library management and database safety.\n\n**
 Favorites**\n\nThere are three new options inside Library Repair:\n\n- **C
 reate Favorites Playlist** creates the Favorites playlist using the right 
 name for your device region.\n- **Fix Missing Favorites** repairs songs in
 jected with an older version that you already favorited but that never act
 ually appeared in Favorites.\n- **Delete Favorites Playlist** lets you del
 ete that playlist from Library Repair.\n\nSongs injected from 2.6 onwards 
 now get their store IDs during injection\, so you can favorite them right 
 away. If the metadata fetcher finds a match\, ByeTunes uses the IDs from t
 hat match. Songs without a match get generated IDs instead.\n\n**Quick rec
 ommendation:** if you have older injected songs that you favorited but can
 not find in Favorites\, run **Fix Missing Favorites** inside Library Repai
 r.\n\n**Playlist Pinning**\n\nYou can now pin and unpin playlists from the
  On-Device Library. Long-press a playlist or use the Pin button from insid
 e it.\n\n**Keep in mind: pinning and unpinning these playlists needs to be
  done through ByeTunes. The Pin option inside the Apple Music app does not
  work for them.**\n\n**Background Downloads**\n\nBackground downloads got 
 a big rework. ByeTunes now uses silent audio to keep downloads going in th
 e background\, with an optional Picture in Picture window so you can see w
 hat is happening after leaving the app.\n\nThe window shows the current so
 ng's progress\, what is next in the queue\, and when metadata is being fet
 ched. You can also customize it with themes\, your own co
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/byetunes.json
